Read AGENTS.md first.

Task: Create a .claudeignore file in the project root.

This file tells Claude Code which files and folders to never read or index.
Do NOT modify any existing code. This is a new file only.

Create `.claudeignore` with exactly this content:

# ============================================
# .claudeignore — Bintan Prestige CMS
# Claude Code: skip these files and folders
# ============================================

# PHP & JS dependencies
vendor/
node_modules/

# Compiled & built assets
public/build/
public/hot/
public/fonts-manifest.dev.json

# Runtime, cache & logs
storage/logs/
storage/framework/cache/
storage/framework/sessions/
storage/framework/views/
storage/app/public/

# Historical AI reports (50+ files — read manually if needed)
ai/reports/

# User-uploaded files (not source code)
public/uploads/
public/storage/

# IDE and editor config
.idea/
.vscode/
.cursor/
.nova/
.zed/
_ide_helper.php
.phpactor.json

# Environment & secrets
.env
.env.*
auth.json

# Git internals
.git/

# PHP test cache
.phpunit.cache/
.phpunit.result.cache

# Temp files
*.log
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store

After creating the file, confirm:
1. File is saved at project root (.claudeignore)
2. List the top 3 folders that will now be skipped
3. Confirm ai/skills/ and ai/guidelines/ are NOT ignored (Claude still needs to read these)

Report using AGENTS.md §11 format.